WEBVTT
NOTE Think Outside the Chat · W2_AIExperience · EN · narrator kokoro:am_michael

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.473
You already use AI. But how you use it matters.

2
00:00:05.673 --> 00:00:08.851
Maybe you ask questions, create content,

3
00:00:08.851 --> 00:00:13.538
analyze information, or use AI to support your daily work.

4
00:00:14.737 --> 00:00:17.563
In this step, we'll learn which tools you use,

5
00:00:17.563 --> 00:00:20.943
what you use them for, and how you interact with them.

6
00:00:22.144 --> 00:00:27.501
We'll also ask approximately how many times you use AI during a working day.

7
00:00:28.701 --> 00:00:33.782
There are no right or wrong answers. Just choose what best describes you today.

8
00:00:34.782 --> 00:00:39.804
Your answers will help us personalize your training and establish your starting point.
